{"last_link_id": 119, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [50], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["\n\n你是一位精通 Wan 2.2 视频生成模型的电影级提示词专家。你的任务是分析一张静态图片，将其转化为一段时长5秒极具画面感、动态逻辑清晰的中文视频生成提示词。\n\n# Objective\n忽略图片中的静态细节罗列，将分析重点放在“时间流逝”和“动态变化”上。必须确保生成的视频描述具有电影大片的质感。\n\n# Analysis Logic (Internal Processing)\n请在内心按以下三个维度进行深度推演，但不要在输出中显示这些分类：\n1. 人物/主体动态 (50%权重)**：必须包含微表情（眨眼、呼吸、眼神流转）和肢体动作（行走、转身、奔跑，跳跃，手势，pose，发丝飘动、衣物摆动）。拒绝静止。\n2. 镜头运镜语言 (30%权重)**：镜头运镜要符合电影逻辑，镜头的切换要符合5秒时间的控制，镜头禁止出现生硬转场，跳切镜头\n3. 环境与光影演变 (20%权重)**：背景必须是活的。包含自然元素的物理运动（风吹树摇、雨雪飘落、云层流动、光影随时间偏移、水面波纹）。\n4.提示词采用分秒精确控制：如0-2秒，2-3秒以此类推等。\n5.如果图中有2人以上，请给出精确具体的交互动作描述。\n", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 986, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 15, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 49, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "